  "body_html": "<h1>finalState_succ</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem finalState_succ (choose : (s : A.State) → A.Action s) (s : A.State) (n : ℕ) : A.finalState choose s (n + 1) = A.finalState choose (A.next s (choose s)) n</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>finalState</li>\n<li>IsReachable.next</li>\n</ul>",
